      "id": "OZtoTusMmCJymObT",
      "name": "Leech-Clip",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "OZtoTusMmCJymObT",
        "folder": "xZvgIBJA7m0AH99M",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Leech-Clip",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are trained to capture deserters, or \"leeches.\" Make a melee Strike with weapon from the flail group. On a hit, the target takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speed (or a –15-foot status penalty on a critical hit). The penalty lasts for 1 round. It applies only if the target has a land Speed and depends on legs or other targetable appendages to use its land Speed. As with all penalties to Speed, this can't reduce a creature's Speed below 5 feet.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Leech-Clip]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "hobgoblin"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "remorseless-lash.json",
      "id": "iRztLGEK5OfjZTPg",
      "name": "Remorseless Lash",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
