    {
      "fileName": "sneaky.json",
      "id": "augNhQ51eSlZyead",
      "name": "Sneaky",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "augNhQ51eSlZyead",
        "folder": "xZvgIBJA7m0AH99M",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Sneaky",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Stealth is an important tool in your arsenal. You can move 5 feet farther when you take the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] action, up to your Speed.</p>\n<p>In addition, as long as you continue to use Sneak actions and succeed at your Stealth check, you don't become observed if you don't have cover or greater cover and aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] at the end of the Sneak action, as long as you have cover or greater cover or are concealed at the end of your turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
